Ghost's only change to the vendored RandomX library: its Argon2 salt.

The salt is the 14 bytes "Ghost-RandomX" followed by the byte 0x01. It keys
every cache, so Ghost's RandomX hashes differ from Monero's and from any other
chain's. Apply from consensus/randomx/librandomx with `patch -p1`.

--- a/src/configuration.h
+++ b/src/configuration.h
@@ -38,7 +38,7 @@
 #define RANDOMX_ARGON_LANES        1
 
 //Argon2d salt
-#define RANDOMX_ARGON_SALT         "RandomX\x03"
+#define RANDOMX_ARGON_SALT         "Ghost-RandomX\x01"
 
 //Number of random Cache accesses per Dataset item. Minimum is 2.
 #define RANDOMX_CACHE_ACCESSES     8
